# Manifest of GGUF artifacts referenced by bench/fair/ and bench/fair-battle.md.
#
# Verify with:   cd bench/fair/weights && sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256 --ignore-missing
# (the filenames below are bare, so sha256sum must run from the directory holding the files;
#  bench/fair/run.sh does exactly that and refuses to start if any present file mismatches.)
#
# bench/fair/protocol.md rule 7: every GGUF used in a bench/fair run has its sha256 recorded
# here BEFORE the run. Every hash below was computed from the local file that produced the
# published number -- none is copied from a model card and none is invented. A file whose
# provenance cannot be stated is marked UNPUBLISHED rather than being quietly listed.
#
# Each entry is preceded by a provenance line: where the bytes came from, and where a reader
# can get the same bytes.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PXA-Fusion2-35B tiers -- the measured artifacts are published at
# huggingface.co/poisonxa/PXA-bench-files-GGUF, one file per published row:
#   https://huggingface.co/poisonxa/PXA-bench-files-GGUF/resolve/main/<filename below>
# (also listed in bench/checksums.sha256, which is the model-card copy of these same hashes)
#
# NOTE on the old location: these tiers were first listed under
# huggingface.co/poisonxa/PXA-Fusion2-35B-GGUF. That repository was renamed to
# poisonxa/PXA-Fusion4-35B-GGUF and keeps the same bytes at revision
# 2d7d9e7e5f445b1ea38a5686b8cf9d6bc9aa29df, so nothing was lost -- but its main branch is now a
# DIFFERENT model, whose PXQ2
# (11,243,296,832 B, sha 92d7c2533f034fc5548254d8f5a427456aec44c1160d95791e5221e985039fc5) and PXQ4
# (19,296,360,576 B, sha 6fc30e1f9d3df634e6c97900ed04f5bd604b92786d351f72931120b00a814cf4) are real
# published artifacts but back none of the Fusion2 rows. A Fusion2 number must be reproduced on a
# Fusion2 file; the renamed repo's main branch is not a substitution. Use the per-file URLs below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2-bit tier. NOTE: re-uploaded 2026-09-02 with the chat-template/tail fix; a copy downloaded
